# en -> fr

#: A
msgid "ASAP"
msgstr "Aussi vite que possible"

#: A@definition
msgid "As soon as possible, next highest priority after stat."
msgstr ""

#: CR
msgid "callback results"
msgstr "A contacter dès que les résultats sont disponibles"

#: CR@definition
msgid "Filler should contact the placer as soon as results are available, even for preliminary results. (Was \"C\" in HL7 version 2.3's reporting priority.)"
msgstr ""

#: EL
msgid "elective"
msgstr "Bénéfique pour le patient mais pas essentiel pour sa survie"

#: EL@definition
msgid "Beneficial to the patient but not essential for survival."
msgstr ""

#: EM
msgid "emergency"
msgstr "Très urgent"

#: EM@definition
msgid "An unforeseen combination of circumstances or the resulting state that calls for immediate action."
msgstr ""

#: P
msgid "preop"
msgstr "A réaliser avant l'intervention"

#: P@definition
msgid "Used to indicate that a service is to be performed prior to a scheduled surgery. When ordering a service and using the pre-op priority, a check is done to see the amount of time that must be allowed for performance of the service. When the order is placed, a message can be generated indicating the time needed for the service so that it is not ordered in conflict with a scheduled operation."
msgstr ""

#: PRN
msgid "as needed"
msgstr "Si nécessaire"

#: PRN@definition
msgid "An \"as needed\" order should be accompanied by a description of what constitutes a need. This description is represented by an observation service predicate as a precondition."
msgstr ""

#: R
msgid "routine"
msgstr "A réaliser aux heures ouvrées"

#: R@definition
msgid "Routine service, do at usual work hours."
msgstr ""

#: RR
msgid "rush reporting"
msgstr "Compte-rendu urgent"

#: RR@definition
msgid "A report should be prepared and sent as quickly as possible."
msgstr ""

#: S
msgid "stat"
msgstr "Immédiatement"

#: S@definition
msgid "With highest priority (e.g., emergency)."
msgstr ""

#: T
msgid "timing critical"
msgstr "Plannification à respecter"

#: T@definition
msgid "It is critical to come as close as possible to the requested time (e.g., for a through antimicrobial level)."
msgstr ""

#: UD
msgid "use as directed"
msgstr "Médicament à utiliser selon les directives du prescripteur"

#: UD@definition
msgid "Drug is to be used as directed by the prescriber."
msgstr ""

#: UR
msgid "urgent"
msgstr "Urgent"

#: UR@definition
msgid "Calls for prompt action."
msgstr ""
